('Nursing','Leadership & Management','bpsc','Which statement best defines Transformational leadership?','motivates through rewards and consequences for task completion','inspires followers toward a shared vision and growth','prioritizes the needs and growth of the team','makes decisions alone with little staff input','b','Correct: inspires followers toward a shared vision and growth','medium','3','true'),
