('Nursing','Leadership & Management','bpsc','A nurse rewarding staff who meet targets. Which leadership style is this?','Autocratic leadership','Democratic leadership','Transactional leadership','Servant leadership','c','Correct: Transactional leadership','medium','3','true'),
