('Nursing','Leadership & Management','bpsc','Which of the following does NOT reflect Autocratic leadership?','rewarding staff who meet targets','correcting staff who fail expectations','empowering staff to reach higher performance','motivating staff toward a shared vision','b','Correct: correcting staff who fail expectations','medium','3','true'),
